whole move:       moved whole ~whole
destructure:      destructured ra rc ~rc ~ra ~rb
partial field:    took pb ~pb ~pa ~pc
box field mut:    replaced ma ~mc assigned c ~ma ~ma2 ~mb ~mc2
self: Box<Self>:  mul uses g1 ~g1 mul3 -> 3 mul uses g2 ~g2 mul2 -> 6 ~g3 add5 -> 11
Box<dyn FnOnce>:  before call ran with captured ~never-called ~captured
list by value:    ~n1 ~n2 ~n3 walked ["n1", "n2", "n3"]
map unbox:        unboxed Some("optbox") vec unboxed 2 ~vb1 ~vb0 ~optbox
